WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.403
Step 1. Open the referral page.

1.2
00:00:02.403 --> 00:00:07.973
Here you start work on the referral and choose the people assigned to it.

2.1
00:00:07.973 --> 00:00:12.795
Step 2. Select Start referral, the green button at the top right.

2.2
00:00:12.795 --> 00:00:16.452
Care changes the status from Pending to In progress,

2.3
00:00:16.452 --> 00:00:19.203
and does not ask you to confirm.

3.1
00:00:19.203 --> 00:00:23.716
Step 3. In the Assigned to section, select Manage assignees.

3.2
00:00:23.716 --> 00:00:26.487
The dialog lists the current assignees,

3.3
00:00:26.487 --> 00:00:30.255
each with an X button that removes the person.

4.1
00:00:30.255 --> 00:00:37.157
Step 4. Open Find team members in, and select a facility or All accessible users.

4.2
00:00:37.157 --> 00:00:42.913
With a facility, Select Member lists the users of that facility.

5.1
00:00:42.913 --> 00:00:43.679
Step 5.

5.2
00:00:43.679 --> 00:00:49.580
Choose the person in Select Member and the role in Select Role, then select Add.

5.3
00:00:49.580 --> 00:00:55.536
Care lists the person and the role below the other assignees.

6.1
00:00:55.536 --> 00:01:00.513
Step 6. Select Save Changes at the bottom right of the dialog.

6.2
00:01:00.513 --> 00:01:06.884
Care shows Referral updated, and Assigned to shows each person with the role.
